    "NaviDrive %@ is available — you have %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive %@ is available — you have %@."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Доступна NaviDrive %1$@, у вас — %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NaviDrive %@ is the latest version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive %@ is the latest version."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive %@ — последняя версия."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NaviDrive is now signed with the permanent “NaviDrive Local” certificate. Your saved sign-in was created by an earlier build with a temporary signature, and macOS doesn’t let the new signature access it, so the old items were removed. Open Settings, re-enter the Client ID and Client Secret if needed, and sign in to Google once more — from now on the sign-in will persist across rebuilds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive теперь подписан постоянным сертификатом «NaviDrive Local». Сохранённый вход был создан прежней сборкой с временной подписью, и macOS не даёт новой подписи доступ к нему, поэтому старые записи удалены. Откройте «Настройки», при необходимости заново введите Client ID и Client Secret и войдите в Google ещё один раз — дальше вход будет сохраняться между пересборками."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NaviDrive is running from a disk image or a read-only folder, so it can’t update itself. Drag NaviDrive to the Applications folder first. The new version’s disk image is in Downloads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive is running from a disk image or a read-only folder, so it can’t update itself. Drag NaviDrive to the Applications folder first. The new version’s disk image is in Downloads."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive запущен из образа диска или из папки только для чтения, поэтому не может обновиться сам. Сначала перетащите NaviDrive в папку «Программы». Образ диска новой версии — в папке «Загрузки»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NaviDrive stopped waiting for a response from %@. Return to NaviDrive and start signing in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NaviDrive перестал ждать ответа от %@. Вернитесь в NaviDrive и начните вход заново."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NaviDrive wasn’t allowed to access %@. To connect it, return to NaviDrive and sign in again.": {
      "localizations": {
